(2736290, 379860, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot with the lighting and poses.  I don''t see a camera anywhere so I''m sure you''ll see lots of DNMC comments.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot with the lighting and poses.  I don''t see a camera anywhere so I''m sure you''ll see lots of DNMC comments.', '2006-08-17 09:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736292, 380052, 35947, '<td valign="top">IMHO, I find this a little static with the center composition.  It doesn''t have much "wow" factor that many of the voters look for.  The lighting could be improved and a different background behind the camera to cover the door could help improve this image.</td>', 'IMHO, I find this a little static with the center composition.  It doesn''t have much "wow" factor that many of the voters look for.  The lighting could be improved and a different background behind the camera to cover the door could help improve this image.', '2006-08-17 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736298, 379983, 35947, '<td valign="top">I may be a little twisted, but added points for the humor I see here!  <br/> <br/>Things I''d suggest to improve this image:  Feet above the head, lighting is a little dark but might be hard to control that in location.  <br/> <br/>Personal observation:  Can''t really tell it''s a camera he''s holding, could be something else.</td>', 'I may be a little twisted, but added points for the humor I see here!   Things I''d suggest to improve this image:  Feet above the head, lighting is a little dark but might be hard to control that in location.   Personal observation:  Can''t really tell it''s a camera he''s holding, could be something else.', '2006-08-17 09:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736299, 378957, 35947, '<td valign="top">I like your set-up, choice of B/W, and use of DOF here.<br/> <br/>Suggestions that could improve this shot IMHO:  Lighting seems a little harsh and personally I''d like to see this reversed canon instead of nonac.</td>', 'I like your set-up, choice of B/W, and use of DOF here. Suggestions that could improve this shot IMHO:  Lighting seems a little harsh and personally I''d like to see this reversed canon instead of nonac.', '2006-08-17 09:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736302, 380914, 35947, '<td valign="top">I like your composition and cropping style.<br/> <br/>Suggestions that could improve this shot IMHO: personally I''d like to see this reversed so it reads left to right, and I find the finger(?) blur in the bottom left distracting.</td>', 'I like your composition and cropping style. Suggestions that could improve this shot IMHO: personally I''d like to see this reversed so it reads left to right, and I find the finger(?) blur in the bottom left distracting.', '2006-08-17 09:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2736303, 380993, 35947, '<td valign="top">Love the white thingy!  <br/> <br/>Suggestions that could improve this shot IMHO:  Image seems a little grainy and I find the bottom line unevenness somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Love the white thingy!   Suggestions that could improve this shot IMHO:  Image seems a little grainy and I find the bottom line unevenness somewhat distracting.', '2006-08-17 09:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
