(2737901, 381152, 33515, '<td valign="top">I bet your wife (or husband) is in the back ground somewhere shaking their head, eaten up with pride that they married a person that would drag a TV out into the back yard to take pictures. J/K :) Cool set up, wish the cables were not so visible.7</td>', 'I bet your wife (or husband) is in the back ground somewhere shaking their head, eaten up with pride that they married a person that would drag a TV out into the back yard to take pictures. J/K :) Cool set up, wish the cables were not so visible.7', '2006-08-17 22:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
