(2737919, 381134, 33515, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have been through validation, congratulations, I figured someone would turn this in. Some people can''t venture outside their box and see a cleaver idea. I wish the mirror(I guess that is hat that is) was more centered on the lens and looks like it''s time to clean the sensor as well. 7</td>', 'Looks like you have been through validation, congratulations, I figured someone would turn this in. Some people can''t venture outside their box and see a cleaver idea. I wish the mirror(I guess that is hat that is) was more centered on the lens and looks like it''s time to clean the sensor as well. 7', '2006-08-17 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
