(2737936, 379212, 33515, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and the wall paper also adds a whimsical feeling as well. I can see how this could be set up as a self portrait, but I guess not all people can.</td>', 'Nice colors and the wall paper also adds a whimsical feeling as well. I can see how this could be set up as a self portrait, but I guess not all people can.', '2006-08-17 22:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737942, 380527, 33515, '<td valign="top">That camera has a cable release! Oh boy. <br/>I feel the other items added to the photo and the tight crop adds a cluttered feeling. Maybe a bit more DOF to keep things in focus as well. Good Luck</td>', 'That camera has a cable release! Oh boy. I feel the other items added to the photo and the tight crop adds a cluttered feeling. Maybe a bit more DOF to keep things in focus as well. Good Luck', '2006-08-17 22:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737948, 381098, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great title!  This is a great concept and a few small things would have really helped insure this was is the top 10/ribboned IMHO.  First I think reversing it so it reads left to right would help, second the sand(?) at the bottom I find distracting (maybe because of the DOF?) and would crop it off, the last thing is the smuggies to the top/right of the 30D (dirty glass?).</td>', 'Great title!  This is a great concept and a few small things would have really helped insure this was is the top 10/ribboned IMHO.  First I think reversing it so it reads left to right would help, second the sand(?) at the bottom I find distracting (maybe because of the DOF?) and would crop it off, the last thing is the smuggies to the top/right of the 30D (dirty glass?).', '2006-08-17 22:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737954, 381150, 35947, '<td valign="top">Most definately an "aaawww" factor here!  Love the title.  Personally I think a different background (without 1/2 the wood door showing) would help, reversing so it reads left to right, and cropping a little more off the bottom.  IMHO the box takes up too much space and isn''t adding to the overall image.</td>', 'Most definately an "aaawww" factor here!  Love the title.  Personally I think a different background (without 1/2 the wood door showing) would help, reversing so it reads left to right, and cropping a little more off the bottom.  IMHO the box takes up too much space and isn''t adding to the overall image.', '2006-08-17 22:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737955, 379613, 33515, '<td valign="top">The dog just will not stay still will he. :) I guess that is the moon behind the camera, I think you would have been better served buy just trying to light the camera and expose for the moon and letting the back ground go black.</td>', 'The dog just will not stay still will he. :) I guess that is the moon behind the camera, I think you would have been better served buy just trying to light the camera and expose for the moon and letting the back ground go black.', '2006-08-17 22:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737964, 380566, 33515, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, like the idea. Maybe if you had used something other than the strap to hold up the camera, something small that would be hard to see. I love the woman laughing. 6</td>', 'Cool photo, like the idea. Maybe if you had used something other than the strap to hold up the camera, something small that would be hard to see. I love the woman laughing. 6', '2006-08-17 22:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2737966, 380267, 35947, '<td valign="top">Foxy!  This image has real potential.  Personally, I think there are a few distractions that take away from your subject, like the picture on the wall, and the bottom inch or so I''d like to see crop''d off, and the lighting is a little on the harsh side.  Just MHO.</td>', 'Foxy!  This image has real potential.  Personally, I think there are a few distractions that take away from your subject, like the picture on the wall, and the bottom inch or so I''d like to see crop''d off, and the lighting is a little on the harsh side.  Just MHO.', '2006-08-17 22:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
