(2738316, 380052, 60614, '<td valign="top">Lighting is not too bad.  May want to try it where you can get more outside natural light.  Also, try using a rectangle mirror so you can crop away the surrounding wall and make sure there isn''t a door in the background to take away from the camera.  Pluse you need to work on the camera''s contrast so you can see the camera''s lines better.  Definately meets the challenge.</td>', 'Lighting is not too bad.  May want to try it where you can get more outside natural light.  Also, try using a rectangle mirror so you can crop away the surrounding wall and make sure there isn''t a door in the background to take away from the camera.  Pluse you need to work on the camera''s contrast so you can see the camera''s lines better.  Definately meets the challenge.', '2006-08-17 23:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
