(2738393, 381057, 60614, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The photo seems a bit grainy and soft which could have been caused by the lighting, auto focusing and being too close to the subject.  If that is the case try manual focus.  I have the exact same camera.  Happy shooting and good luck.</td>', 'Great composition.  The photo seems a bit grainy and soft which could have been caused by the lighting, auto focusing and being too close to the subject.  If that is the case try manual focus.  I have the exact same camera.  Happy shooting and good luck.', '2006-08-18 00:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2738405, 380860, 60614, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  It is very creative.  I don''t know if too many others will because it is abstract and different.  But it is a winner in my eyes.  The title fits perfectly.</td>', 'I like this shot.  It is very creative.  I don''t know if too many others will because it is abstract and different.  But it is a winner in my eyes.  The title fits perfectly.', '2006-08-18 00:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
