(2738639, 380234, 40320, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite of the challenge.  It tells a story more than just a shot of a camera.  I particularly like the way you used two subjects to balance the emotional rawness without distracting from the focal point of the challenge.  Great job.</td>', 'This was my favorite of the challenge.  It tells a story more than just a shot of a camera.  I particularly like the way you used two subjects to balance the emotional rawness without distracting from the focal point of the challenge.  Great job.', '2006-08-18 01:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
