(2738781, 381222, 62554, '<td valign="top">Don''t believe this meets the challenge of camera shooting itself.<br/> <br/>In light of fresh info:-<br/>Image a little out of focus and lacking vibrance (a little washed out).  Composition good but the "rope" is a little distracting because of its'' texture against the black of the camera body.  Upgrade to 3</td>', 'Don''t believe this meets the challenge of camera shooting itself. In light of fresh info:-Image a little out of focus and lacking vibrance (a little washed out).  Composition good but the "rope" is a little distracting because of its'' texture against the black of the camera body.  Upgrade to 3', '2006-08-18 02:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
