(2739132, 379863, 62187, '<td valign="top">Sweet...depending on how others go, I''m sure it will be a ribbon winner. Great idea, great background and great photo! 10+</td>', 'Sweet...depending on how others go, I''m sure it will be a ribbon winner. Great idea, great background and great photo! 10+', '2006-08-18 09:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
