(2740105, 380950, 63655, '<td valign="top">Very,very,very nice. I gave it a 9.<br/>I don''t really see that many pictures here that say something.<br/>To me, this one really does.<br/>Very creative and well-executed!<br/>I hope you do well in the challenge.</td>', 'Very,very,very nice. I gave it a 9.I don''t really see that many pictures here that say something.To me, this one really does.Very creative and well-executed!I hope you do well in the challenge.', '2006-08-18 17:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
