(2743792, 380276, 18197, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant in its own way. If it were my photo, I would have flipped it so the words read correctly, but that''s just a personal preference. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Simple and elegant in its own way. If it were my photo, I would have flipped it so the words read correctly, but that''s just a personal preference. Among my top picks.', '2006-08-20 16:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743794, 378985, 18197, '<td valign="top">Arguably among the most artistic and appealing images in the challenge. Very well conceived and executed. If I were king for a day, it would ribbon.</td>', 'Arguably among the most artistic and appealing images in the challenge. Very well conceived and executed. If I were king for a day, it would ribbon.', '2006-08-20 16:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743798, 380885, 18197, '<td valign="top">Clever! I''m not sure how you did it and I''d like to understand. Having the small image fronting the larger image is brilliant, as is the lighting which sets off the small image without hurting the larger one. I am not usually a fan of high grain, but I like it a lot in this instance. Hope it does well inthe voting because it''s among my top picks.</td>', 'Clever! I''m not sure how you did it and I''d like to understand. Having the small image fronting the larger image is brilliant, as is the lighting which sets off the small image without hurting the larger one. I am not usually a fan of high grain, but I like it a lot in this instance. Hope it does well inthe voting because it''s among my top picks.', '2006-08-20 16:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743799, 380950, 60173, '<td valign="top">This has taken me a week to see, but then again I guess I hadn''t read the title, because the second I did I saw it. Yeesh!</td>', 'This has taken me a week to see, but then again I guess I hadn''t read the title, because the second I did I saw it. Yeesh!', '2006-08-20 16:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743804, 381035, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautifully conceived and executed. Probably the most elegant self portrait here. Colors, comp, focus &amp; lighting are all superb. I like that you flipped the image so "Nikon" reads correctly. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Beautifully conceived and executed. Probably the most elegant self portrait here. Colors, comp, focus & lighting are all superb. I like that you flipped the image so "Nikon" reads correctly. Among my top picks.', '2006-08-20 16:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2743807, 380229, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love the dark edgy treatment! The composition is wonderful. B&amp;W works well. Artistic. Emotional. This is certainly the most out-of-the-box entry in the challenge! I therefore fear it will be trashed in the voting. But I gave it a 10 and it''s obviously among my top picks in this challenge.</td>', 'I love the dark edgy treatment! The composition is wonderful. B&W works well. Artistic. Emotional. This is certainly the most out-of-the-box entry in the challenge! I therefore fear it will be trashed in the voting. But I gave it a 10 and it''s obviously among my top picks in this challenge.', '2006-08-20 16:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
