(2747933, 381238, 60195, '<td valign="top">I''m inclined to say that there''s not enough of the intended "subject" in this "camera" self-portrait, but there''s just something about the artistic quality of this shot... I keep coming back to it.  Find it rare that I give out a 10, but you get one for making me look at it this much  ;o)</td>', 'I''m inclined to say that there''s not enough of the intended "subject" in this "camera" self-portrait, but there''s just something about the artistic quality of this shot... I keep coming back to it.  Find it rare that I give out a 10, but you get one for making me look at it this much  ;o)', '2006-08-22 04:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2747970, 381203, 64412, '<td valign="top">Very interesting</td>', 'Very interesting', '2006-08-22 04:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
