(2747985, 378700, 62554, '<td valign="top">Reassessed following clarification.<br/>Seems all photography is really smoke and mirrors!  Thrown originally by the "correct" representation of the words (expected them to be reversed).  Upgraded vote recorded.</td>', 'Reassessed following clarification.Seems all photography is really smoke and mirrors!  Thrown originally by the "correct" representation of the words (expected them to be reversed).  Upgraded vote recorded.', '2006-08-22 04:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2747990, 381266, 34238, '<td valign="top">Good composition, dramic colours, you could say it was a self portrait of a camera but would like to see a not so obvious shot of the photographer. Even something obscured would have made this more interesting. Good photography.</td>', 'Good composition, dramic colours, you could say it was a self portrait of a camera but would like to see a not so obvious shot of the photographer. Even something obscured would have made this more interesting. Good photography.', '2006-08-22 04:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2747993, 380854, 62764, '<td valign="top">Very cool</td>', 'Very cool', '2006-08-22 04:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2747995, 379293, 62764, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but where''s the camera?</td>', 'Nice shot but where''s the camera?', '2006-08-22 04:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2747997, 380699, 34238, '<td valign="top">One of the things I like to think about when looking at these submissions is how the shot was taken. I would like to thing that this is a reflection. Another good shot. The use of colour and composition makes this photo, as does the precarious method to which the camera has been supported. There''s more achievement from making your own tripod than buying one. Top marks.</td>', 'One of the things I like to think about when looking at these submissions is how the shot was taken. I would like to thing that this is a reflection. Another good shot. The use of colour and composition makes this photo, as does the precarious method to which the camera has been supported. There''s more achievement from making your own tripod than buying one. Top marks.', '2006-08-22 04:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2747999, 378502, 62764, '<td valign="top">Clever idea</td>', 'Clever idea', '2006-08-22 04:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748053, 377882, 31299, '<td valign="top">sorry, but i just don''t get it. a bit dark and lighting is not directed  well.</td>', 'sorry, but i just don''t get it. a bit dark and lighting is not directed  well.', '2006-08-22 06:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
