(2748114, 380950, 64035, '<td valign="top">Original idea, and I can''t wait to find out how you did it. I''m not convinced that the end image is that aesthetically pleasing or involving, though. Bonus points for being different and for the technical interest!</td>', 'Original idea, and I can''t wait to find out how you did it. I''m not convinced that the end image is that aesthetically pleasing or involving, though. Bonus points for being different and for the technical interest!', '2006-08-22 07:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748116, 379536, 64035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though I could wish the reflections in the lens - by far the most interesting part - were easier to see. If they were more of a feature, then I''d give this a higher mark.</td>', 'Nice shot, though I could wish the reflections in the lens - by far the most interesting part - were easier to see. If they were more of a feature, then I''d give this a higher mark.', '2006-08-22 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748117, 381222, 64035, '<td valign="top">I like the colours in the set dressing - the blue of the rope and the orangey-red of the flag. I can''t quite work out whether there''s a message, though.</td>', 'I like the colours in the set dressing - the blue of the rope and the orangey-red of the flag. I can''t quite work out whether there''s a message, though.', '2006-08-22 07:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748120, 380927, 64035, '<td valign="top">The highlighted green is an interesting and incongrous feature - I like that a lot. The right hand image of the camera is just a bit of an eyesore to me, that obliterates the more interesting left hand. Nice wood colour, too.</td>', 'The highlighted green is an interesting and incongrous feature - I like that a lot. The right hand image of the camera is just a bit of an eyesore to me, that obliterates the more interesting left hand. Nice wood colour, too.', '2006-08-22 07:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748121, 380699, 60987, '<td valign="top">nice sunset and siloute. maybe if the camera was more the subject. person tends to distract me from the camera. mabye. i don''t know. i like the shot tho and well done!</td>', 'nice sunset and siloute. maybe if the camera was more the subject. person tends to distract me from the camera. mabye. i don''t know. i like the shot tho and well done!', '2006-08-22 07:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748123, 377673, 60987, '<td valign="top">better lighting on the camera. just a bit too dark.</td>', 'better lighting on the camera. just a bit too dark.', '2006-08-22 07:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748124, 381139, 64035, '<td valign="top">This almost feels like it''s playing with the old sexist saw of "women doing their make-up while driving", but it''s not quite playful enough for that. If that was what you were going for, I suspect you''ve been only partially successful. Unsure about the decision to flip the image, as well.</td>', 'This almost feels like it''s playing with the old sexist saw of "women doing their make-up while driving", but it''s not quite playful enough for that. If that was what you were going for, I suspect you''ve been only partially successful. Unsure about the decision to flip the image, as well.', '2006-08-22 07:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748125, 381266, 60987, '<td valign="top">very creative and well shot. good work</td>', 'very creative and well shot. good work', '2006-08-22 07:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748128, 380527, 60987, '<td valign="top">always sad to see any camera die. farewell.</td>', 'always sad to see any camera die. farewell.', '2006-08-22 07:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748129, 381098, 64035, '<td valign="top">Focus is loose, and the conceit is a little weak - you could make more of the "me and my little brother" thing - perhaps a bucket and spade? - and the image would be more humorous and hence more interesting. As it is, it''s a credible shot of two cameras and some shells, and not a lot more.</td>', 'Focus is loose, and the conceit is a little weak - you could make more of the "me and my little brother" thing - perhaps a bucket and spade? - and the image would be more humorous and hence more interesting. As it is, it''s a credible shot of two cameras and some shells, and not a lot more.', '2006-08-22 07:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748132, 380276, 64035, '<td valign="top">I like the enlarged lens appearance. Apart from that, though, it''s just a bit... well, run of the mill.</td>', 'I like the enlarged lens appearance. Apart from that, though, it''s just a bit... well, run of the mill.', '2006-08-22 07:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748133, 379444, 64035, '<td valign="top">Amusing, but the reflection in the lens is an irritation rather than a feature. Nice light, though.</td>', 'Amusing, but the reflection in the lens is an irritation rather than a feature. Nice light, though.', '2006-08-22 07:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748134, 381168, 64035, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure quite how to rate this. It''s in some ways one of the more interesting images in this challenge - the scratches and flecks on the lens are far more fascinating than numerous images of glossy, perfect, black cameras. Kudos for not flipping the image, as this adds to the interest. It''s just...it''s not a very friendly image, and it''s almost like it doesn''t fit anywhere on my internal rating scheme. I think that''s a definite positive, on reflection. (chortle at weak joke)</td>', 'I''m not sure quite how to rate this. It''s in some ways one of the more interesting images in this challenge - the scratches and flecks on the lens are far more fascinating than numerous images of glossy, perfect, black cameras. Kudos for not flipping the image, as this adds to the interest. It''s just...it''s not a very friendly image, and it''s almost like it doesn''t fit anywhere on my internal rating scheme. I think that''s a definite positive, on reflection. (chortle at weak joke)', '2006-08-22 07:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748137, 379613, 64035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Lovely colours on the shed and in the sky. In some ways, the challenge is getting in the way of the picture here, as the camera is the least interesting thing in the shot. Nice texture and detail on the tripod. A technically good picture.</td>', 'Nice shot. Lovely colours on the shed and in the sky. In some ways, the challenge is getting in the way of the picture here, as the camera is the least interesting thing in the shot. Nice texture and detail on the tripod. A technically good picture.', '2006-08-22 07:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748140, 380944, 64035, '<td valign="top">*laugh* - good joke, and visually interesting. Nice sepia. The beads are top touch too.</td>', '*laugh* - good joke, and visually interesting. Nice sepia. The beads are top touch too.', '2006-08-22 07:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748141, 381259, 64035, '<td valign="top">The red is a nice touch. It turns a boring image into something more threatening - you pull in 2001 in your title, but there''s something far more 1984 here. Good work!</td>', 'The red is a nice touch. It turns a boring image into something more threatening - you pull in 2001 in your title, but there''s something far more 1984 here. Good work!', '2006-08-22 07:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748146, 381234, 64035, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea, and a gorgeous photograph. I''m not sure that the blurred frame of the mirror is a desirable feature, however. Still, it''s far more interesting than the majority of shots in this challenge, and there''s a glossy feel - and the tightness and cleanness of the focus and tone stands out a mile. Good job!</td>', 'Very nice idea, and a gorgeous photograph. I''m not sure that the blurred frame of the mirror is a desirable feature, however. Still, it''s far more interesting than the majority of shots in this challenge, and there''s a glossy feel - and the tightness and cleanness of the focus and tone stands out a mile. Good job!', '2006-08-22 07:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2748158, 381168, 60987, '<td valign="top">a little over exposed around the lens and lens a little smudged, but you already know that i''m sure. good work.</td>', 'a little over exposed around the lens and lens a little smudged, but you already know that i''m sure. good work.', '2006-08-22 08:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
