(2749053, 381262, 52500, '<td valign="top">I had this same idea, but then discovered that the LCD does not stay on when it actually takes the pic.  I never thought to take one, print it, stick it on there, etc.  Very well done.</td>', 'I had this same idea, but then discovered that the LCD does not stay on when it actually takes the pic.  I never thought to take one, print it, stick it on there, etc.  Very well done.', '2006-08-22 15:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
