(2749062, 380630, 52500, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool looking bike!  Great idea.  I like the little pieces of you and the camera in each mirror.</td>', 'That''s a cool looking bike!  Great idea.  I like the little pieces of you and the camera in each mirror.', '2006-08-22 15:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2749071, 379293, 52500, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably heard this a million times now, but I wanted to let you know why the low vote from me.  I think you missed the part in the description of the challenge that says "use your camera to take a picture of itself".  Putting that aside, this pic is noisy and there does not appear to be anything in focus.</td>', 'You''ve probably heard this a million times now, but I wanted to let you know why the low vote from me.  I think you missed the part in the description of the challenge that says "use your camera to take a picture of itself".  Putting that aside, this pic is noisy and there does not appear to be anything in focus.', '2006-08-22 15:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2749093, 379863, 52500, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit of a stretch as the challenge is stated.  The camera and its shadow are not the same thing.  So, I can''t give you more than a 5 for an outstanding pic.</td>', 'I think this is a bit of a stretch as the challenge is stated.  The camera and its shadow are not the same thing.  So, I can''t give you more than a 5 for an outstanding pic.', '2006-08-22 15:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2749100, 379860, 52500, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably heard this a million times now, but I wanted to let you know why the low vote from me.  I think you missed the part in the description of the challenge that says "use your camera to take a picture of itself".  Other than that, it''s a fine photo.</td>', 'You''ve probably heard this a million times now, but I wanted to let you know why the low vote from me.  I think you missed the part in the description of the challenge that says "use your camera to take a picture of itself".  Other than that, it''s a fine photo.', '2006-08-22 15:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2749106, 380883, 52500, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably heard this a million times now, but I wanted to let you know why the low vote from me.  I think you missed the part in the description of the challenge that says "use your camera to take a picture of itself".  Other than that, I think this is a very cool self portrait.  Always a good idea to use the full size allowed, by the way. (640xsomething)</td>', 'You''ve probably heard this a million times now, but I wanted to let you know why the low vote from me.  I think you missed the part in the description of the challenge that says "use your camera to take a picture of itself".  Other than that, I think this is a very cool self portrait.  Always a good idea to use the full size allowed, by the way. (640xsomething)', '2006-08-22 15:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2749107, 380680, 52500, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably heard this a million times now, but I wanted to let you know why the low vote from me.  I think you missed the part in the description of the challenge that says "use your camera to take a picture of itself".  Beyond that, I like the image, but nothing seems to be in sharp focus.</td>', 'You''ve probably heard this a million times now, but I wanted to let you know why the low vote from me.  I think you missed the part in the description of the challenge that says "use your camera to take a picture of itself".  Beyond that, I like the image, but nothing seems to be in sharp focus.', '2006-08-22 15:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
