(2751465, 380234, 61191, '<td valign="top">23rd place? I expected this to be among the top ten. Your facial expression is great. This photo has such a strong atmosphere! The black eye adds even more drama. You hit your eye with a hammer? Ouch, that has to hurt. Though I don''t know how this could happen, it''s a real feat ;)</td>', '23rd place? I expected this to be among the top ten. Your facial expression is great. This photo has such a strong atmosphere! The black eye adds even more drama. You hit your eye with a hammer? Ouch, that has to hurt. Though I don''t know how this could happen, it''s a real feat ;)', '2006-08-23 06:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2751549, 381033, 61679, '<td valign="top">Jeanne,<br/> <br/>Another creative shot.  I scored this a six because I thought you executed your plan very well.  I would have scored it higher if there were no cars in the background (headlights are too bright), thus making the words in the mirror more visible.  A different shooting location would have worked also.  Nice job!<br/> <br/>Tim</td>', 'Jeanne, Another creative shot.  I scored this a six because I thought you executed your plan very well.  I would have scored it higher if there were no cars in the background (headlights are too bright), thus making the words in the mirror more visible.  A different shooting location would have worked also.  Nice job! Tim', '2006-08-23 07:30:45.000000', NULL, 0),
