(2751910, 379863, 35357, '<td valign="top">I call my camera "My Baby."  My kids, 5 and 8, call it "Daddy''s Baby."<br/> <br/>A couple of weekends ago we were visiting friends, who have a small child.  We spent the day at the beach &amp; I put my camera bag on a beach chair next to me.  Their child wanted to open my camera bag.  I told him "No, my baby is in there, be careful."  Of course my children chimed in, "YES, BE VERY CAREFUL AROUND DADDY''S BABY!  DON''T HURT DADDY''S BABY!"<br/> <br/>The child was intrigued that I kept a baby in such a small bag.  :-D</td>', 'I call my camera "My Baby."  My kids, 5 and 8, call it "Daddy''s Baby." A couple of weekends ago we were visiting friends, who have a small child.  We spent the day at the beach & I put my camera bag on a beach chair next to me.  Their child wanted to open my camera bag.  I told him "No, my baby is in there, be careful."  Of course my children chimed in, "YES, BE VERY CAREFUL AROUND DADDY''S BABY!  DON''T HURT DADDY''S BABY!" The child was intrigued that I kept a baby in such a small bag.  :-D', '2006-08-23 09:25:55.000000', NULL, 0),
