(2764963, 380972, 13077, '<td valign="top">I think the grain adds some interest to it, without the grain it would just be a straightforward picture of someone''s arm, half of their face, and a camera. Besides, everyone aleady knows what arms look like, and cameras and walls, so they don''t need to be literal :p</td>', 'I think the grain adds some interest to it, without the grain it would just be a straightforward picture of someone''s arm, half of their face, and a camera. Besides, everyone aleady knows what arms look like, and cameras and walls, so they don''t need to be literal :p', '2006-08-27 19:45:21.000000', NULL, 0),
